=== lock_device map[deviceId:1]
isError: false
--- text
{
  "appConnected": false,
  "deviceId": 1,
  "expiresAt": "<time>",
  "owner": "mcp:alice:<session>"
}

=== unlock_device map[deviceId:1]
isError: false
--- text
device 1 unlocked

=== release_device map[deviceId:1]
isError: true
--- text
lock the device for control first (call lock_device with deviceId 1 first)

